4-d05b-48df-8167-856a2d7758be","uuid":"66511c0d-849d-4fb2-93a8-06c542f1d03c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:11:20.107Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"On branch main\nYour branch is up to date with 'origin/main'.\n\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\n\tmodified:   ../../../README.md\n\tmodified:   ../../../matrix.config.json\n\tmodified:   ../../index.html\n\tmodified:   ../../results.csv\n\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n\t../../claude-haiku-5-5-medium__20261102-185845__x22cc1b/\n\t../../claude-haiku-5-5-medium__20261102-190205__xac1bf5/\n\t../\n\t../../claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181307__x22cc1b__Rewired-TheWire/\n\t../../claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181310__xac1bf5/\n\t../../claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181313__x3ec78e__TheBaritones-TheSopranos/\n\t../../claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181316__x96eb17__TheSopraniacs-TheSopranos/\n91c2a11 Pinned variants, short names that follow their text, and the Nov 1 runs' old wording under names of its own (#18)\nec70f32 Each game's record, schema 2: AI Hub fields, the exit interview, and runs rebuilt from games alone (#17)\n35b876e Run start times to the second, and a batch's runs start 3 s apart (#16)\n045908c Nov 1 runs: 24 games of books, movies, TV shows and Seinfeld, and the config they ran with (#15)\nc653270 Each stage's models in Setup · Advanced; run folders named by source, start time and game title (#14)\n/home/micha/.nvm/versions/node/v24.22.1/bin/node\n/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/python3\n/usr/bin/gh\n/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/git\nv24.22.1\ngithub.com\n  ✓ Logged in to github.com account michaelcrosato (/home/micha/.config/gh/hosts.yml)\n  - Active account: true\nHTTP/2 200 \r\ndate: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 02:11:19 GMT\r\ncontent-type: text/html; charset=utf-8","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOu